-- BeeAware Global roadmap — Northern Ireland LGD (council) geometry.
--
-- Real boundaries for Northern Ireland's 11 councils ("Local Government
-- Districts", 2015 reorganisation), fetched live from the ONS Open
-- Geography Portal's 'Local Authority Districts (December 2023)
-- Boundaries UK BGC' ArcGIS FeatureServer (the same UK-wide portal
-- already used for the England & Wales Police Force geometry,
-- 20260831120000 — that dataset just never included Northern Ireland's
-- own councils since it's EW-only) — no key needed, filtered to codes
-- starting 'N' (LAD23CD), confirmed live: exactly 11 features, matching
-- Northern Ireland's real council count exactly. Coordinates rounded to
-- 4 decimals (~11m), same precision family as Portugal/Spain's own
-- display geometry (20260902100000/20260903100000) — comparable size
-- (317KB total across 11 features vs. Portugal's 308).
--
-- See ni_police.ts's own header for the SEPARATE, coarser polygon
-- simplification used to query data.police.uk itself (this display
-- geometry is far too detailed for a URL query parameter, same relation
-- as UkPoliceAdapter's own FORCE_QUERY_POLYGONS to its display geometry).
